l\00\00\00\00\10set_pool_address\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cpool_address\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00#Obter endere\c3\a7o da pool configurada\00\00\00\00\10get_pool_address\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00!Verificar se pool foi configurada\00\00\00\00\00\00\12is_pool_configured\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b5Aprovar pool para puxar fundos SBRL (settlement)\0aSECURITY FIX: Necess\c3\a1rio para o pull mechanism funcionar\0aA credit-demand deve aprovar explicitamente a pool para usar transfer_from\00\00\00\00\00\00\1bapprove_pool_for_settlement\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dtoken_address\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cpool_address\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11expiration_ledger\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\01nTrigger settlement with pool - calls pool's credit_demand_pay_investors_sbrl\0aSECURITY FIX: This function allows credit-demand to authorize the pool call\0aThe credit-demand contract authorizes itself as caller when invoking the pool\0a\0aWorkflow:\0a1. Call approve_pool_for_settlement first (to allow pool to pull funds)\0a2. Then call this function to trigger the settlement\00\00\00\00\00\17trigger_pool_settlement\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cpool_address\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03fee\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0camortization\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\0bSECURITY FIX: Trigger batched pool settlement\0a\0aThis function allows credit-demand to trigger batched settlement on the pool.\0aUse this for large pools with many investors to avoid gas limits.\0a\0aWorkflow:\0a1. Call approve_pool_for_settlement first (to allow pool to pull funds on first batch)\0a2. Call this function with batch_start=0 to start new session\0a3. Continue calling with increasing batch_start until \22complete\22 is returned\0a\0aReturns: \22batch_ok\22 for partial, \22complete\22 for finished, \22sess_act\22 if session already active\00\00\00\00\1dtrigger_pool_settlement_batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cpool_address\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03fee\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0camortization\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bbatch_start\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0abatch_size\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\bfIDX-4: liquida\c3\a7\c3\a3o em lote com corre\c3\a7\c3\a3o monet\c3\a1ria. Sim\c3\a9trica a `trigger_pool_settlement_batch`\0a(OPERATOR, `require_auth`), mas chama `cd_pay_batch_mu` do pool:\0a`amount == amortization + fee + monetary_update` (`fee` = s\c3\b3 juros; o pool confere e recusa `inv_sum`).\0a\0aNecess\c3\a1ria para pool com mais de 50 investidores e `mon > 0` (a fun\c3\a7\c3\a3o \c3\banica recusa com `use_bat`).\0aFluxo: `approve_pool_for_settlement(amount)`, depois `batch_start = 0, batch_size, 2 x batch_size, ...`\0aat\c3\a9 `complete`. Como o gatilho antigo, N\c3\83O altera o estado da parcela do credit-demand (quem concilia \c3\a9 o\0aoperador). Retornos: `unauth`, `not_init`, `inv_amt` (amount <= 0) e os do pool (ver docs/idx4-monetary-update.md).\00\00\00\00 trigger_pool_settlement_batch_mu\00\00\00\08\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cpool_address\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03fee\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0camortization\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fmonetary_update\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bbatch_start\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0abatch_size\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\11\00\00